### Check that the server works
GET http://localhost:8080/hello

### Create a room
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numberOfPlayers": 4
}

### Get the room
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/WBGZWL

### Join the room
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomCode": "WBGZWL",
  "name": "Alice"
}

### Get the room again
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/WBGZWL

### Get room after Alice joined
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/WBGZWL

### Invalid room code—should return 404 or 400
    POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomCode": "XXXXXX",
  "name": "Charlie"
}